  pose proof (CHA.wf_blk _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ WFT (PSOIW.bptr I, PSOIW.bcap I) (IBG _ (INB I))) as KBB; destruct KBB as ((KB0 & KB1 & KB16 & KB3 & KB4 & (KB5 & KB6 & KB7)) & KBdef & KBsha & KBbap & KBfap);
  cbn [fst snd] in KB0, KB1, KB16, KB3, KB4, KB5, KB6, KB7, KBdef, KBsha, KBbap, KBfap;
  pose proof (CHA.wf_blk _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ WFT (PSOIW.sb I, PSOIW.scap I) (IBG _ (INS I))) as KSS; destruct KSS as ((KS0 & KS1 & KS16 & KS3 & KS4 & (KS5 & KS6 & KS7)) & KSdef & KSsha & KSbap & KSfap);
