  pose proof (PSOIW.WFX I) as WFX'; destruct WFX' as (WF1 & WF2 & WF3 & WF4 & WF5 & WF6 & WF7 & WF8 & WF9);
  pose proof (PSOIW.BBX I) as BBX'; destruct BBX' as (BB1 & BB2 & BB3);
